# The point of this experiment is that the goldens live IN-REPO. The two prior
# attempts at this work left their evidence in /tmp and lost it. The repo-root
# `*.log` rule would silently drop every golden from the commit -- the artifacts
# would look stored and would not be -- so it is negated here, scoped to this
# directory only.
!goldens/*.log
__pycache__/
